Lei das Contravenções Penais (Decreto-Lei 3.688/1941), Lei dos Crimes de Responsabilidade (Lei 1.079/1950) and Lei 7.716/1989 (crimes resultantes de preconceito de raça ou de cor) verified 2026-10-31: replay of each act's annotated Planalto page (24 versions) against Planalto's text: Lei 7.716 against its consolidated page (l7716compilado.htm), the other two (no consolidated page) against the unstruck text of their pages: 0 differences, 0 problems. In-force days from the acts' own clauses (DL 3.688 art. 72: 1.1.1942; Lei 7.716 art. 21: publication) or LINDB art. 1 (Lei 1.079 has no vigência clause: 27.5.1950); Decreto-Lei 6.916/1944 in force on publication (its own words); LC 227/2026 (arts. 79-A/79-B) on publication 14.1.2026. 'Vide ADPF 1259/1260' (Lei 1.079) and 'Vide ADO 26' (Lei 7.716) change no words: open items in decisions. Duplicate-label, duplicate-line and note-leak checks clean; first-line check shows only the Código Penal-style rubricas of the LCP; parse twice identical (sha256 dbe2c636); merged scratch build 79 acts, 1805 versions, 1578 commits, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean on main and futuro.
